        "panel_eyebrow": "Shade and shelter",
        "panel_heading": "Covered RV Decks: Adding a Gazebo or Shelter",
        "panel_text": "You can make a permanent-feeling RV shelter by setting a freestanding gazebo or pergola over a 12x12 or 16x16 A-DIY deck. It adds shade and shelter from rain without attaching anything to your RV. Check your campground's rules on covered structures first.",
