            "social_icon": "trustpilot",
            "review_text": "The customer service from day one was great. I had not seen the specific size deck I wanted so reached out and the team was very responsive and said it wasn't a problem at all accommodating the size I needed.\n\nAbsolutely everything needed came with the kit. I didn't need to get anything extra. The build process could not have been simpler."
