            "author_handle": "",
            "headline": "",
            "social_icon": "trustpilot",
            "review_text": "The deck expert answered all my questions. I was able to track my order easily. When it arrived there was one cracked board. I took a picture and responded to the email they sent asking if the order had arrived in good condition. I received my new board within a week. The quality of the wood was outstanding! The instructions are clear and all the pieces are clearly marked. We have already highly recommended ADIY to our friends. We will be putting it together next week and are beyond excited!"
          }
